            "text": "theorem velocity_on_axis (H K : Profile) (t : ℝ) (x : Space)\n    (hH : DifferentiableAt ℝ H (profilePoint t x))\n    (hK : DifferentiableAt ℝ K (profilePoint t x)) (hx0 : x 0 = 0) (hx1 : x 1 = 0) :\n    velocity H K (t, x) = H (t, (0, x 2)) • coordinateVector 2"
